@startuml
skinparam ranksep 40
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Developer as dev

box "Spring 核心容器" #WhiteSmoke
participant "AbstractApplicationContext" as AC
participant "DefaultListableBeanFactory" as BLF
participant "AbstractAutowireCapableBeanFactory" as AACBF
end box

box "后置处理器" #LightBlue
participant "PostProcessorRegistrationDelegate" as PPRD
participant "InstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessor" as IBPP
participant "CommonAnnotationBeanPostProcessor" as CA_BPP
participant "AbstractAutoProxyCreator" as AAPC
end box

box "业务 Bean" #LightGreen
participant "YourBean" as Bean
end box

dev -> AC: **refresh()**
activate AC
AC -> BLF: finishBeanFactoryInitialization()
activate BLF
BLF -> AACBF: preInstantiateSingletons() -> getBean() -> doGetBean() -> createBean()

note over AACBF #FFE4B5
  <b>【开发者扩展点 0】</b>
  InstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessor.postProcessBeforeInstantiation
  (实例化前，可短路返回代理对象)
end note
AACBF -> IBPP: postProcessBeforeInstantiation()
IBPP --> AACBF: null (未短路)

== 1. 实例化 ==
AACBF -> Bean: createBeanInstance()\n调用构造函数
note over Bean #E6E6FA
  此时对象已在内存中，但属性为空
end note

== 2. 早期暴露 (解决循环依赖) ==
AACBF -> AACBF: addSingletonFactory()\n放入第三级缓存 singletonFactories

== 3. 属性注入 ==
note over AACBF #FFE4B5
  <b>【开发者扩展点 1】</b>
  InstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessor.postProcessAfterInstantiation
  (实例化后，属性注入前，可短路默认注入逻辑)
end note
AACBF -> IBPP: postProcessAfterInstantiation()
IBPP --> AACBF: true (继续注入)

note over AACBF #FFE4B5
  <b>【开发者扩展点 2】</b>
  InstantiationAwareBeanPostProcessor.postProcessProperties
  (解析 @Autowired, @Value，完成属性注入)
end note
AACBF -> IBPP: postProcessProperties()
IBPP -> Bean: 反射设置属性值 (@Autowired 注入)

== 4. 初始化阶段 ==
AACBF -> AACBF: initializeBean()
activate AACBF #DarkSeaGreen

note over AACBF #FFE4B5
  <b>【开发者扩展点 3】</b>
  Aware 接口回调
end note
AACBF -> Bean: invokeAwareMethods()\n(BeanNameAware, BeanFactoryAware等)
note right of Bean #E6E6FA
  此时 Bean 拿到了容器底层组件
end note

note over AACBF #FFE4B5
  <b>【开发者扩展点 4】</b>
  BeanPostProcessor.postProcessBeforeInitialization
  (初始化前回调)
end note
AACBF -> CA_BPP: postProcessBeforeInitialization()
activate CA_BPP
CA_BPP -> Bean: 执行带有 @PostConstruct 的方法
deactivate CA_BPP

note over AACBF #FFE4B5
  <b>【开发者扩展点 5】</b>
  自定义初始化方法
end note
AACBF -> Bean: invokeInitMethods()
activate Bean #E6E6FA
Bean -> Bean: InitializingBean.afterPropertiesSet()
Bean -> Bean: 自定义 init-method()
deactivate Bean

note over AACBF #FFD700
  <b>【开发者扩展点 6】AOP 核心入口</b>
  BeanPostProcessor.postProcessAfterInitialization
  (初始化后回调)
end note
AACBF -> AAPC: postProcessAfterInitialization()
activate AAPC
AAPC -> AAPC: 判断是否符合切点
AAPC --> AACBF: 返回代理对象 (替换原始 Bean)
deactivate AAPC

deactivate AACBF
AACBF -> AACBF: addSingleton()\n放入第一级缓存 singletonObjects
deactivate AACBF
deactivate BLF

== 5. 容器就绪 ==
AC -> AC: finishRefresh()
note over AC #E0FFFF
  <b>【事件发布】</b>
  发布 ContextRefreshedEvent
end note

== 6. 销毁阶段 (容器关闭时) ==
dev -> AC: close()\n(或注册的 ShutdownHook 触发)
AC -> AACBF: destroySingletons()
note over AACBF #FFE4B5
  <b>【开发者扩展点 7】</b>
  销毁回调
end note
AACBF -> Bean: destroyBean()
activate Bean #E6E6FA
Bean -> Bean: @PreDestroy 方法执行
Bean -> Bean: DisposableBean.destroy()
Bean -> Bean: 自定义 destroy-method()
deactivate Bean

@enduml